    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_91004",
    "NameLanText": "望天门山",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_91004",
    "DescriptionLanText": "天门中断楚江开，\n碧水东流至此回。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_91004",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>天门中断楚江开，碧水东流至此回。\n两岸青山相对出，孤帆一片日边来。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_91004",
    "Description2LanText": "《望天门山》据传作于青年李白行舟初遇天门山时。以山势对峙写水势浩荡，以水势奔腾写山势奇险，山水与红日扑面而来，写尽意境开阔与气魄之豪放飘逸。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_91004",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
