    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_91005",
    "NameLanText": "游洞庭湖五首 其二",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_91005",
    "DescriptionLanText": "且就洞庭赊月色，\n将船买酒白云边。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_91005",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>南湖秋水夜无烟，耐可乘流直上天。\n且就洞庭赊月色，将船买酒白云边。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_91005",
    "Description2LanText": "《游洞庭湖五首 其二》作于李白与友人同游之时。水天相接，且向这清冷湖水赊几杯粼粼月影，行舟去那白云边，与君共饮。身边是友人，湖水亦是我友人。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_91005",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
