    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_91006",
    "NameLanText": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_91006",
    "DescriptionLanText": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，\n烟花三月下扬州。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_91006",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。\n孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_91006",
    "Description2LanText": "《黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵》作于送别友人之时。故人告别此地，在繁花相随的春日驶向扬州。以江水迢递，烟波浩渺写与孟夫子之交往，情谊内敛而深厚。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_91006",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_15"
  },
  "91007": {
    "ID": "91007",
    "Type": 1,
