    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_91007",
    "NameLanText": "望庐山瀑布 其二",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_91007",
    "DescriptionLanText": "飞流直下三千尺，\n疑是银河落九天。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_91007",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>日照香炉生紫烟，遥看瀑布挂前川。\n飞流直下三千尺，疑是银河落九天。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_91007",
    "Description2LanText": "《望庐山瀑布 其二》据传作于李白出游庐山之时。以天地一香炉写景之迷离，以白练挂山川写水势之利落，三千尺银河自九天下落。太白灵气奇思，惊为天人。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_91007",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
