    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_91008",
    "NameLanText": "独坐敬亭山",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_91008",
    "DescriptionLanText": "相看两不厌，\n只有敬亭山。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_91008",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>众鸟高飞尽，孤云独去闲。\n相看两不厌，只有敬亭山。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_91008",
    "Description2LanText": "《独坐敬亭山》据传作于李白失意独游敬亭山之时。群鸟消散于天边，偶来的白云闲散飘忽，天地间只剩我与敬亭山对坐。遗世独立，深知山水之趣。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_91008",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
