    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_01",
    "Point": 1,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92001",
    "NameLanText": "赠孟浩然",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92001",
    "DescriptionLanText": "吾爱孟夫子，\n风流天下闻。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92001",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>吾爱孟夫子，风流天下闻。\n红颜弃轩冕，白首卧松云。\n醉月频中圣，迷花不事君。\n高山安可仰，徒此揖清芬。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92001",
    "Description2LanText": "《赠孟浩然》据传作于李白知交孟浩然远游之时，他登门拜访无果。孟夫子少时不恋冠冕，如今隐逸山林，品行高山仰止，世间闻名。遗憾错过，在此作揖拜别。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92001",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_18"
  },
  "92002": {
    "ID": "92002",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
      {
        "id": "3",
        "count": 10000
      }
    ],
    "Rate": 500,
    "Min": 1,
    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_02",
    "Point": 2,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92002",
    "NameLanText": "沙丘城下寄杜甫",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92002",
    "DescriptionLanText": "思君若汶水，\n浩荡寄南征。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92002",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>我来竟何事，高卧沙丘城。\n城边有古树，日夕连秋声。\n鲁酒不可醉，齐歌空复情。\n思君若汶水，浩荡寄南征。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92002",
    "Description2LanText": "《沙丘城下寄杜甫》据传是李白与杜甫同游分别后，感怀而作。这城啊，只有老树与萧瑟秋风，日夜作响。流水不息，一如思君之情，浩荡随君行。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92002",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_19"
  },
  "92003": {
    "ID": "92003",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
      {
        "id": "2105",
        "count": 5
      }
    ],
    "Rate": 500,
    "Min": 2,
    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_03",
    "Point": 3,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92003",
    "NameLanText": "对酒忆贺监二首 其一",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92003",
    "DescriptionLanText": "长安一相见，\n呼我谪仙人。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92003",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>四明有狂客，风流贺季真。\n长安一相见，呼我谪仙人。\n昔好杯中物，翻为松下尘。\n金龟换酒处，却忆泪沾巾。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92003",
    "Description2LanText": "《对酒忆贺监二首 其一》为李白凭吊贺知章之作。李白初至京师，贺监闻其名而拜访，高呼谪仙人，以解金龟换酒为乐。今对酒忆贺公，伤怀泪沾巾。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92003",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_20"
  },
  "92004": {
    "ID": "92004",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
      {
        "id": "3001",
        "count": 1
      }
    ],
    "Rate": 500,
    "Min": 3,
    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_04",
    "Point": 4,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92004",
    "NameLanText": "闻王昌龄左迁龙标遥有此寄",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92004",
    "DescriptionLanText": "我寄愁心与明月，\n随风直到夜郎西。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92004",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40> 杨花落尽子规啼，闻道龙标过五溪。\n 我寄愁心与明月，随风直到夜郎西。\n(我寄愁心与明月，随君直到夜郎西。)</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92004",
    "Description2LanText": "《闻王昌龄左迁龙标遥有此寄》为李白听闻好友被贬，自远道寄去的关切之作。柳絮纷飞子规鸣泣的风中，我将愁思托付给朗照两地的同一轮明月，伴君同行。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92004",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_21"
  },
  "92005": {
    "ID": "92005",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
      {
        "id": "3",
        "count": 10000
      }
    ],
    "Rate": 500,
    "Min": 4,
    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_05",
    "Point": 6,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92005",
    "NameLanText": "赠汪伦",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92005",
    "DescriptionLanText": "桃花潭水深千尺，\n不及汪伦送我情。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92005",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>李白乘舟将欲行，忽闻岸上踏歌声。\n桃花潭水深千尺，不及汪伦送我情。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92005",
    "Description2LanText": "《赠汪伦》据载作于李白漫游桃花潭之时。江上舟将行，踏歌声中想起友人款待数日，筹我以美酒，迎我游十里桃林。这情谊，深过潭水千尺。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92005",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_22"
  },
  "92006": {
    "ID": "92006",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
