    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_06",
    "Point": 5,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_92006",
    "NameLanText": "上李邕",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_92006",
    "DescriptionLanText": "大鹏一日同风起，\n扶摇直上九万里。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_92006",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>大鹏一日同风起，扶摇直上九万里。\n假令风歇时下来，犹能簸却沧溟水。\n世人见我恒殊调，闻余大言皆冷笑。\n宣父犹能畏后生，丈夫未可轻年少。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_92006",
    "Description2LanText": "《上李邕》据传作于青年李白游谒李邕，奈何不欢而散之时。开篇化用《庄子·逍遥游》,写大鹏气势之大。以“风起”“风歇”写自身，胸中之志一如自由的大鹏，年少高飞。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_92006",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·李白",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_23"
  },
