    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_93001",
    "NameLanText": "宿建德江",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_93001",
    "DescriptionLanText": "野旷天低树，\n江清月近人。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_93001",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>移舟泊烟渚，日暮客愁新。\n野旷天低树，江清月近人。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_93001",
    "Description2LanText": "《宿建德江》据传作于孟浩然仕途失意漫游之时。停舟江上，夜幕低垂，凉雾压低天空，低过旷野上的树木；明月晃晃，近似人心。新愁与此地旅人，寂寥何以排遣。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_93001",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·孟浩然",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
