    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_93002",
    "NameLanText": "登高",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_93002",
    "DescriptionLanText": "无边落木萧萧下，\n不尽长江滚滚来。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_93002",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。\n无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。\n万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。\n艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_93002",
    "Description2LanText": "《登高》据传作于离开草堂南下途中。老来病痛，有感于飘零，万物萧索，长江不息，唯有老者，独步远眺。笔力沉郁，气韵已臻化境，古今独步。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_93002",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·杜甫",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_27"
  },
  "93003": {
    "ID": "93003",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
      {
        "id": "2105",
