    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_93003",
    "NameLanText": "蓟中作",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_93003",
    "DescriptionLanText": "边城何萧条，\n白日黄云昏。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_93003",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>策马自沙漠，长驱登塞垣。\n边城何萧条，白日黄云昏。\n一到征战处，每愁胡虏翻。\n岂无安边书，诸将已承恩。\n惆怅孙吴事，归来独闭门。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_93003",
    "Description2LanText": "《蓟中作》据载作于高适送兵后，返回封丘之时。打马过沙漠，驱策来边疆，只有惨淡的天光与昏黄的云气。以萧条的边城写边患深重与自身激愤，力透纸背。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_93003",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·高适",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
      "ui_yysh_jl_jh"
    ],
    "Voice": "TangPoetry_28"
  },
  "93004": {
    "ID": "93004",
    "Type": 1,
    "Reward": [
