    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_93004",
    "NameLanText": "回乡偶书二首 其一",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_93004",
    "DescriptionLanText": "儿童相见不相识，\n笑问客从何处来。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_93004",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=40>少小离家老大回，乡音无改鬓毛衰。\n儿童相见不相识，笑问客从何处来。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_93004",
    "Description2LanText": "《回乡偶书二首 其一》据传作于贺知章辞官告老之时。久客他乡数十年，耄耋之年归乡，离家时也像村口的孩童一般。如今风吹鬓发，世事易老，信手偶得之。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_93004",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·贺知章",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
