    "Icon": "ui_yysh_jz_06",
    "Point": 6,
    "NameLan": "activeLan_lottery_namelan_93006",
    "NameLanText": "衔命还国作",
    "DescriptionLan": "activeLan_lottery_descriptionLan_93006",
    "DescriptionLanText": "平生一宝剑，\n留赠结交人。",
    "Description1Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description1_93006",
    "Description1LanText": "<size=32>衔命将辞国，非才忝侍臣。\n天中恋明主，海外忆慈亲。\n伏奏违金阙，騑骖去玉津。\n蓬莱乡路远，若木故园林。\n西望怀恩日，东归感义辰。\n平生一宝剑，留赠结交人。</size>",
    "Description2Lan": "activeLan_lottery_description2_93006",
    "Description2LanText": "《衔命还国作》为日本遣唐使阿倍仲麻吕归国后赠大唐友人所作。两地西东，海阔天遥，故园千里。与诸君结交乃平生幸事，愿观剑念我，音信不绝。",
    "DynastyLan": "activeLan_lottery_dynasty_93006",
    "DynastyLanText": "唐·晁衡",
    "Punctuation": [
      "ui_yysh_jl_dh",
